+## MIME types
+
+Navidrome loads the default [`mime_types.yaml`](resources/mime_types.yaml) at startup. To customize it, place a complete
+`mime_types.yaml` in `<DataFolder>/resources/` and restart. The `types` mapping uses dot-prefixed file extensions as
+keys, and `lossless` lists the dot-prefixed extensions shown as lossless formats in the UI.
+
